<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-11T22:53:08.679Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:53:08 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities arrested an alleged major leader of the Jalisco New Generation Cartel in Zapopan and seized a cartel cell with DEA assistance, while a mayor was found alive after an hours-long abduction. A slain cartel boss known as &amp;quot;The General&amp;quot; is alleged to have supplied fake police identification to Ryan Wedding to facilitate drug trafficking, and a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7‑year-old American girl. In Chiapas, 14 suspected Sinaloa cartel members were detained, including two believed to be regional leaders. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYXhEUmc1OTQzZmZqSU1adTk3UzFDSXBwLXQ0LVJTUkthMlpBQi0yNE40V1hLR0JuNG4wanpOZlIzTlBPMjZlN3lYTkVBbzRyQmVEOVJkcWtvWElJRHJfNE1vanRDcVFnUFlZcjJha0huX2J5clZmZU9HNTdvT2k3VmdWcmZyNHF2MUpSNloyeF9tdUxoOTlqb1pjbW1TSmdVRk1Kbnk5dlBpak96dF9WUGdtcHUtNlpTUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOX2poMEk4Z2VpRnBTcXJua3dRd2EwZWxSOHN0c29HRG5VWWJtNFF2RXBaU2g3amhiaWJSNlhCUjBJRjN0TEZVZVJTcHVkNjZNczVhQUVyYTBGSWl2R0dWMlF3dFZKTmluTjR1a0lXdWVaaUduRVg2TUQxakVVUlBDOTZSeW1qQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;FOX 11 Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WABI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQdE5NVHVHaEw5Y0c1cmk2MmlDbElRTk1JeXBrZ2NXQUhZVDg4ODJ2M2FyQnpZQjVoT0doRW9uNTBOVm5mdlRpaDUtVG9NdjlhTnhnYnpVS0V4N0ZSTjRfOEdjUF9JWWRoQzlmQWZFM0l4aDRDTk8xbzhtUGpvaEtnS3ZWajNsaXY2YXVoZ0ZFTFRrSzhBcmNmLU9rX3k?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://